VERDICT: PASS
====================================================================================

  The target is the pinned tree, no smoke override is present, and every
  path value is ordinary text. A caller may invoke the runner.

  RESIDUAL, stated because it cannot be closed from a clone: each
  harness/bin/run-<tool>.sh remains executable in its own right, and an
  invocation that does not read this exit status is not bound by it. In
  particular run-trivy.sh lines 52-53 still interpolate $TRIVY_CACHE_DIR into
  python3 -c source. Closing that at its root is a provisioning change: pass
  the metadata path as positional argv to fixed code instead of interpolating
  environment text into program source.
